@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<h1>P.Pager for ASP.NET Core MVC</h1>

<p>Demos of the <code>@@Html.Pager</code> HTML helper and the <code>&lt;pager&gt;</code> Tag Helper from P.Pager.Mvc.Core:</p>

<ul>
    <li><a asp-controller="Members" asp-action="Index">Pager</a>: page numbers, sorting, page size, themes and options from the query string.</li>
    <li><a asp-controller="Members" asp-action="Slice">Slice (no count)</a>: previous / next paging without a <code>COUNT</code> query.</li>
    <li><a asp-controller="Members" asp-action="Cursor">Cursor (keyset)</a>: seek paging with <code>?after=</code> / <code>?before=</code> cursors, fast on deep pages.</li>
    <li><a asp-controller="Members" asp-action="Gallery">All options</a>: every layout preset, theme and text option.</li>
</ul>
